{"term":{"label":"智","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i","title":"離婁上","description":"孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"二","id":"二"},{"form":"信","id":"信"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"實","id":"實"},{"form":"居","id":"居"},{"form":"弗","id":"弗"},{"form":"悅","id":"悅"},{"form":"斯","id":"斯"},{"form":"智","id":"智"},{"form":"樂","id":"樂"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"濯","id":"濯"},{"form":"禮","id":"禮"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"誠","id":"誠"},{"form":"諸","id":"諸"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.005333569526114,"source":"諸","target":"反"},{"weight":2.6984807500860595,"source":"諸","target":"求"},{"weight":2.6984807500860595,"source":"二","target":"斯"},{"weight":2.880802306880014,"source":"二","target":"實"},{"weight":1.7821900182119044,"source":"二","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.6984807500860595,"source":"二","target":"智"},{"weight":2.005333569526114,"source":"二","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.293015641977895,"source":"二","target":"樂"},{"weight":2.629487878599108,"source":"信","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.8526314299133175,"source":"斯","target":"濯"},{"weight":2.747270914255491,"source":"斯","target":"實"},{"weight":1.6486586255873816,"source":"斯","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.5649493574615367,"source":"斯","target":"智"},{"weight":1.8718021769015913,"source":"斯","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.159484249353372,"source":"斯","target":"樂"},{"weight":2.1186622548331173,"source":"悅","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.629487878599108,"source":"樂","target":"實"},{"weight":1.9363406980391626,"source":"實","target":"義"},{"weight":2.1186622548331173,"source":"實","target":"弗"},{"weight":3.0349529867072724,"source":"實","target":"智"},{"weight":2.341805806147327,"source":"實","target":"禮"},{"weight":3.258096538021482,"source":"智","target":"反"},{"weight":3.0349529867072724,"source":"智",